{"server":"tw","storyId":"act5d0_level_act5d0_01_end","groupId":"act5d0","stageId":"act5d0_01","title":"6:44P.M.","storyCode":"CB-1","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_01_end.txt","sourceHash":"d9b725e37d2a7face3fd5fe4c97f959a91014425ebd1fcbd9cb172f3fe0ecee4","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_pgbase_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"7:10 P.M.    天氣/晴\n企鵝物流據點，糟糕的室內"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡就是企鵝物流的據點......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"（好亂，而且好暗。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"只是我們的據點之一，沒怎麼好好收拾，隨意坐吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，謝謝......我好像還沒有正式向你們道謝，企鵝物流的各位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"只是工作，先做個自我介紹好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"——信使，代號拜松，來自龍門峯馳物流，受家父指教，前來貴司參觀學習，請多關照。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"關於我與大帝先生的合約內容，雖然之前已經確認過了，但還是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"慢著，我有個小問題，你那人高馬大的爹是怎麼把你養得這麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......老闆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好，你繼續。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，關於剛才的襲擊，無疑是對峯馳物流和企鵝物流的挑釁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"這件事情絕不能輕視，如果有必要的話，我會通知家父和近衛局，此事應當被視作一起惡性襲擊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，德克薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"晚上吃什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎派對！還用問嗎？但是空去哪兒了，不是留下看家了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"反正只要德克薩斯聯繫她的話，她立刻就能趕回來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，抱歉，你接著說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"（空？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......咳，當務之急是調查那些襲擊我們的敵人，企鵝物流的各位有什麼頭緒嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"頭緒？不就是普通的業務糾紛嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，業務糾紛......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯！我抽屜裡的雪茄呢！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆，我們已經好久沒回過這個據點了，恐怕早就發霉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"空來打掃過，可能那時候扔掉了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那我今天晚上會死的，不行，這可不行......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你繼續，別在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"首先我們應該明確敵人的目的——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"慢著，音樂！我的黑膠唱片！是不是放了一箱在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好像是我搬來的。那一箱得有我好幾個月薪水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"在這兒，要聽哪張？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"隨便哪張都行，被我選中的只會是宇宙末日級精品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，音樂，有了藝術的人生才不會無聊，讚美音樂，以及我自己！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"拜松，接著說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......我、我說到哪了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"對！他們的目的應該是我，也許，是為了挑撥貴司與我司的關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼啊，這點小事，還以為只是給之前的事情報仇......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"您有什麼線索嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"——咳咳！德克薩斯！去調查一下他們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"加班費，三倍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，這種程度的打架每個月都會有個十七八次啦。信使不都是這樣工作的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"信使不是應該更加隱密一點，迅速一點......從來不是以武力為標準的啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們明明是個物流公司，為什麼總是被捲進幫派鬥爭裡去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"因為他們的品味太低，對自己生而為人的品味太低。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"也因為老闆發我們薪水嘛。不過還是有在遵紀守法地運送貨物啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"只是大部分時候都會變成武裝運送而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"對嘛，這有什麼問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......？這真的沒問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"先等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡，是空留下的密碼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"餅、餅乾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，幹嘛要打開了放在這裡，受潮了就不好吃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"有巧克力的一面是長，尾巴是短，這是密碼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"（這是什麼獨特的密碼學......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？那時候是當真的嗎？不是玩笑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......我只是普通地記下了空的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"“可疑分子”，唔，空可能追出去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"隨她去吧，已經到下班時間了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"今天可是安魂夜，沒有加班，沒有資本主義的壓迫，否則死人都難安心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"晚上誰想去喝一杯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，莫非老闆請客？上次才進了一批價格不菲的藏酒~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"完全沒問題，反正你們幾個有大把的薪水可以扣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"那算了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！那個......我們沒有什麼對策嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"不需要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"就放任這些黑手黨？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"走一步看一步囉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......龍門近衛局不會介入嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"大概不會吧 ，他們應該都習慣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"既來之則安之。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"但上個月的公物損害賠償清單有點多，大夥各自都稍微注意一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......那，平時的工作呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"按照委託送貨，然後打架。如果要打架的話，打架優先。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"順便一提，任何委託只過老闆一手，至於誰來做，誰能搶到就算誰的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，叫拜松的小子，你爹把你託付給我們，哪怕只是暫時的，你也是企鵝物流的一員了，明白嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"——明白，呃，大概吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼你就必須記住，企鵝物流員工須知的第一條重要規定，那就是：“不拘小節”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天不還是“娛樂至死”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得是“及時行樂”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"......差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"想要綁架你這樣的公子哥的罪犯不在少數，按我們的規矩，來一個打一個，就這麼簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"——等等，怎麼感覺屁股怪怪的，我完美的人體工程學沙發椅下是不是有什麼東西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？我看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好可愛的糖果盒，老闆，你竟然在椅子下面偷藏零食！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"胡說，我怎麼會蠢到把零食藏在這種——糖果盒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"就是糖果盒啊，上面還寫著“維多利亞水果軟糖”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"離遠點能天使，那大概是個陷阱，別打開——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，趴下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["德克薩斯"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["能天使"]},{"speakerId":"char_105_emper","aliases":["大帝"]},{"speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","aliases":["可頌"]},{"speakerId":"char_325_bison","aliases":["拜松"]}]}
